{"seq":1,"slug":"mqtt-protocol","title":"MQTT 协议架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols/mqtt-protocol","wordCount":702,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"mqtt-协议架构\">MQTT 协议架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>MQTT（Message Queuing Telemetry Transport）是物联网领域最广泛使用的轻量级消息协议，基于发布/订阅（Pub/Sub）模式设计。MQTT 最初由 IBM 的 Andy Stanford-Clark 和 Arlen Nipper 于 1999 年为石油管道监控创建，其极低的带宽消耗和简洁的协议设计使其成为资源受限 IoT 设备的首选通信协议。MQTT 5.0 是当前最新版本，在 3.1.1 基础上增加了共享订阅、消息过期等特性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Publisher 发布者] --&gt;|发布消息| B[MQTT Broker]&#10;    B --&gt;|转发消息| C[Subscriber 订阅者 1]&#10;    B --&gt;|转发消息| D[Subscriber 订阅者 2]&#10;    B --&gt;|转发消息| E[Subscriber 订阅者 N]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|订阅主题| B&#10;    D -.-&gt;|订阅主题| B&#10;    E -.-&gt;|订阅主题| B&#10;    subgraph IoT 设备&#10;        A&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 云端/边缘&#10;        B&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 应用端&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[Publisher 发布者] --&gt;|发布消息| B[MQTT Broker]\n    B --&gt;|转发消息| C[Subscriber 订阅者 1]\n    B --&gt;|转发消息| D[Subscriber 订阅者 2]\n    B --&gt;|转发消息| E[Subscriber 订阅者 N]\n    C -.-&gt;|订阅主题| B\n    D -.-&gt;|订阅主题| B\n    E -.-&gt;|订阅主题| B\n    subgraph IoT 设备\n        A\n    end\n    subgraph 云端/边缘\n        B\n    end\n    subgraph 应用端\n        C\n        D\n        E\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>MQTT</th>\n<th>HTTP</th>\n<th>CoAP</th>\n<th>AMQP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>TCP</td>\n<td>TCP</td>\n<td>UDP</td>\n<td>TCP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息模式</td>\n<td>Pub/Sub</td>\n<td>Req/Res</td>\n<td>Req/Res</td>\n<td>Pub/Sub + Queue</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议开销</td>\n<td>2 字节最小头</td>\n<td>~100+ 字节头</td>\n<td>4 字节头</td>\n<td>~8 字节帧头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QoS 等级</td>\n<td>3 级（0/1/2）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>CON/NON</td>\n<td>事务 + 确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长连接</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（HTTP/1.1 Keep-Alive）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>IoT 遥测</td>\n<td>Web API</td>\n<td>受限网络 IoT</td>\n<td>企业消息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mqtt-协议栈\">MQTT 协议栈</h2><p>MQTT 协议由 14 种控制报文组成，每个报文由固定头部（2 字节）+ 可变头部 + 载荷构成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// MQTT 控制报文类型&#10;// CONNECT     (1)  客户端→Broker 连接请求&#10;// CONNACK     (2)  Broker→客户端 连接确认&#10;// PUBLISH     (3)  发布消息&#10;// PUBACK      (4)  QoS 1 确认&#10;// PUBREC      (5)  QoS 2 第一步确认&#10;// PUBREL      (6)  QoS 2 第二步确认&#10;// PUBCOMP     (7)  QoS 2 第三步确认&#10;// SUBSCRIBE   (8)  订阅请求&#10;// SUBACK      (9)  订阅确认&#10;// UNSUBSCRIBE (10) 取消订阅&#10;// UNSUBACK    (11) 取消确认&#10;// PINGREQ     (12) 心跳请求&#10;// PINGRESP    (13) 心跳响应&#10;// DISCONNECT  (14) 断开连接\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// MQTT 控制报文类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CONNECT     (1)  客户端→Broker 连接请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CONNACK     (2)  Broker→客户端 连接确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PUBLISH     (3)  发布消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PUBACK      (4)  QoS 1 确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PUBREC      (5)  QoS 2 第一步确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PUBREL      (6)  QoS 2 第二步确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PUBCOMP     (7)  QoS 2 第三步确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SUBSCRIBE   (8)  订阅请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SUBACK      (9)  订阅确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// UNSUBSCRIBE (10) 取消订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// UNSUBACK    (11) 取消确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PINGREQ     (12) 心跳请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// PINGRESP    (13) 心跳响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// DISCONNECT  (14) 断开连接</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>QoS 等级</strong>是 MQTT 最重要的设计之一：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph QoS 0 最多一次&#10;        A1[Publisher] --&gt;|PUBLISH| B1[Broker]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph QoS 1 至少一次&#10;        A2[Publisher] --&gt;|PUBLISH| B2[Broker]&#10;        B2 --&gt;|PUBACK| A2&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph QoS 2 恰好一次&#10;        A3[Publisher] --&gt;|PUBLISH| B3[Broker]&#10;        B3 --&gt;|PUBREC| A3&#10;        A3 --&gt;|PUBREL| B3&#10;        B3 --&gt;|PUBCOMP| A3&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph QoS 0 最多一次\n        A1[Publisher] --&gt;|PUBLISH| B1[Broker]\n    end\n    subgraph QoS 1 至少一次\n        A2[Publisher] --&gt;|PUBLISH| B2[Broker]\n        B2 --&gt;|PUBACK| A2\n    end\n    subgraph QoS 2 恰好一次\n        A3[Publisher] --&gt;|PUBLISH| B3[Broker]\n        B3 --&gt;|PUBREC| A3\n        A3 --&gt;|PUBREL| B3\n        B3 --&gt;|PUBCOMP| A3\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>QoS</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>消息数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>最多一次</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>传感器遥测（可丢失）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>至少一次</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>告警通知（可重复）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>恰好一次</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>支付/控制命令（不可丢、不可重复）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入式-mqtt-客户端实现\">嵌入式 MQTT 客户端实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 使用 Eclipse Paho MQTT-C（适合 MCU）&#10;#include &quot;MQTTClient.h&quot;&#10;&#10;MQTTClient client;&#10;Network network;&#10;unsigned char sendbuf[256], readbuf[256];&#10;&#10;void mqttInit(void) {&#10;    NetworkInit(&amp;network);&#10;    NetworkConnect(&amp;network, &quot;broker.example.com&quot;, 1883);&#10;&#10;    MQTTClientInit(&amp;client, &amp;network, 5000,&#10;        sendbuf, sizeof(sendbuf), readbuf, sizeof(readbuf));&#10;&#10;    MQTTPacket_connectData options = MQTTPacket_connectData_initializer;&#10;    options.clientID.cstring = &quot;sensor-node-001&quot;;&#10;    options.keepAliveInterval = 60;&#10;    options.cleansession = 1;&#10;    options.willFlag = 1;&#10;    options.will.topicName.cstring = &quot;devices/sensor-001/status&quot;;&#10;    options.will.message.cstring = &quot;offline&quot;;&#10;    options.will.qos = 1;&#10;    options.will.retained = 1;&#10;&#10;    MQTTConnect(&amp;client, &amp;options);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void publishSensorData(float temp, float humidity) {&#10;    char payload[128];&#10;    snprintf(payload, sizeof(payload),&#10;        &quot;{\\&quot;temp\\&quot;:%.1f,\\&quot;hum\\&quot;:%.1f,\\&quot;ts\\&quot;:%lu}&quot;,&#10;        temp, humidity, HAL_GetTick());&#10;&#10;    MQTTMessage msg = {&#10;        .qos = QOS1,&#10;        .retained = 0,&#10;        .payload = payload,&#10;        .payloadlen = strlen(payload)&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    MQTTPublish(&amp;client, &quot;devices/sensor-001/data&quot;, &amp;msg);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 Eclipse Paho MQTT-C（适合 MCU）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"MQTTClient.h\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MQTTClient client;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Network network;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">unsigned</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> sendbuf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">readbuf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mqttInit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    NetworkInit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">network);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    NetworkConnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">network, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"broker.example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1883</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    MQTTClientInit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">network, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sendbuf, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sendbuf), readbuf, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(readbuf));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MQTTPacket_connectData options </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MQTTPacket_connectData_initializer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.clientID.cstring </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"sensor-node-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.keepAliveInterval </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.cleansession </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.willFlag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.will.topicName.cstring </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"devices/sensor-001/status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.will.message.cstring </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"offline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.will.qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    options.will.retained </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    MQTTConnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">options);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> publishSensorData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> temp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> humidity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> payload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    snprintf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">temp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%.1f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hum</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%.1f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%lu</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        temp, humidity, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HAL_GetTick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MQTTMessage msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .qos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> QOS1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .retained </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .payload </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .payloadlen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> strlen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    MQTTPublish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"devices/sensor-001/data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msg);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"主题设计与安全\">主题设计与安全</h2><p><strong>主题层次设计</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"devices/{device-id}/telemetry      # 设备遥测数据&#10;devices/{device-id}/status         # 设备在线状态&#10;devices/{device-id}/commands       # 下发控制命令&#10;devices/{device-id}/config         # 设备配置更新&#10;alerts/{severity}/{device-id}      # 告警消息&#10;$SYS/broker/clients/connected      # 系统主题\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>devices/{device-id}/telemetry      # 设备遥测数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>devices/{device-id}/status         # 设备在线状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>devices/{device-id}/commands       # 下发控制命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>devices/{device-id}/config         # 设备配置更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alerts/{severity}/{device-id}      # 告警消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$SYS/broker/clients/connected      # 系统主题</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>安全措施</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安全层</th>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>TLS 1.2/1.3</td>\n<td>加密通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证</td>\n<td>用户名/密码</td>\n<td>基本认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证</td>\n<td>X.509 客户端证书</td>\n<td>双向认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权</td>\n<td>ACL 规则</td>\n<td>主题级权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>载荷</td>\n<td>应用层加密</td>\n<td>端到端加密</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mqtt-5-0-新特性\">MQTT 5.0 新特性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享订阅</td>\n<td>多个客户端分摊同一主题</td>\n<td>负载均衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息过期</td>\n<td>设置消息 TTL</td>\n<td>过时数据自动丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求/响应</td>\n<td>关联 ID + 响应主题</td>\n<td>RPC 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主题别名</td>\n<td>整数替代长主题字符串</td>\n<td>减少带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户属性</td>\n<td>键值对元数据</td>\n<td>自定义路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流量控制</td>\n<td>接收最大值</td>\n<td>防止客户端过载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话过期</td>\n<td>可配置会话生命周期</td>\n<td>灵活持久化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MQTT 基于发布/订阅模式，最小 2 字节协议头，是 IoT 遥测的首选协议</li>\n<li>三级 QoS（0/1/2）在可靠性和性能间提供灵活选择，遥测用 QoS 0，命令用 QoS 1/2</li>\n<li>遗愿消息（Will Message）实现设备离线自动通知</li>\n<li>主题层次应按 设备/功能/方向 组织，使用通配符（+/# ）实现灵活订阅</li>\n<li>安全需要 TLS + 认证 + ACL 三层防护，生产环境必须使用客户端证书</li>\n<li>MQTT 5.0 增加了共享订阅、消息过期、请求/响应等企业级特性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MQTT 协议架构","id":"mqtt-协议架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MQTT 协议栈","id":"mqtt-协议栈"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入式 MQTT 客户端实现","id":"嵌入式-mqtt-客户端实现"},{"level":2,"text":"主题设计与安全","id":"主题设计与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"MQTT 5.0 新特性","id":"mqtt-5-0-新特性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Zephyr RTOS 与现代嵌入式框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/zephyr-and-modern-frameworks"},"next":{"title":"BLE 蓝牙低功耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/iot-protocols/ble-bluetooth-low-energy"}}